
[TestCredentialsErrorReadsAsSentences - 1]
Crush cannot run gemini-4-hydrogen: Google Vertex AI (vertexai) has no credentials. Set VERTEXAI_PROJECT and VERTEXAI_LOCATION in the environment of the Crush server, then restart it. A server on this machine takes the environment of the first client to open the directory; a server on another machine uses its own. It also needs Google Application Default Credentials on the server's machine (`gcloud auth application-default login`).
